WEBVTT

00:08.975 --> 00:17.017
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:17.017 --> 00:25.015
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.532 --> 00:36.336
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.336 --> 00:39.339
Believing, dreaming

00:39.339 --> 00:43.176
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:43.176 --> 00:48.307
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:50.116 --> 00:58.525
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.525 --> 01:03.096
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:03.096 --> 01:05.765
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.765 --> 01:14.040
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:14.040 --> 01:19.000
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.547 --> 01:27.180
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

02:15.435 --> 02:16.902
I can't do that.

02:23.209 --> 02:26.474
Azuma's Kitchen really does make
some delicious taiyaki!

02:26.546 --> 02:29.282
That place in front of the station
is pretty good too.

02:29.282 --> 02:32.809
Their bean filling is quite good,
but the way they bake it is a little...

02:37.790 --> 02:41.419
How can he be so laid-back
when we're out to kill him?

02:47.934 --> 02:50.164
What is it, Master Loki?

02:50.336 --> 02:52.304
Oh, nothing.

02:54.007 --> 02:56.441
What's with that attitude?!
Well, I'll show him!

03:08.288 --> 03:10.085
They're so pretty.

03:16.729 --> 03:18.026
What?!

03:20.833 --> 03:26.499
The 20th Night
The Red Shoes

03:28.208 --> 03:31.578
You're late, Skuld. What were you doing?

03:31.578 --> 03:34.274
Uh, I was just...

03:34.914 --> 03:36.506
It doesn't matter. Let's begin.

03:44.123 --> 03:47.354
Our plans to eliminate Lord Loki
have failed repeatedly.

03:48.027 --> 03:52.327
If this takes us any more time, we will have
no more excuses to offer Lord Odin.

03:53.566 --> 03:59.439
We've shifted our target from Lord Loki
to those who surround him,

03:59.439 --> 04:01.566
but our results have been no better.

04:33.539 --> 04:36.075
It would seem the problem has been
with the targets we've chosen.

04:36.075 --> 04:38.211
Yes, that may be a possibility.

04:38.211 --> 04:42.181
Perhaps we should have started by
attacking the weaker ones first.

04:42.181 --> 04:44.350
Are you listening, Skuld?

04:44.350 --> 04:45.918
Yes, sister.

04:45.918 --> 04:47.587
Pull yourself together.

04:47.587 --> 04:49.020
I'm sorry.

04:50.890 --> 04:54.694
In any case, Lord Loki will likely
be more cautious than ever.

04:54.694 --> 04:57.830
We'll have to formulate our plans
more carefully from now on.

04:57.830 --> 05:01.789
You're right. If we want a plan
that's likely to succeed...

05:04.570 --> 05:06.538
that would make her our next target.

05:07.874 --> 05:10.043
In that case, our next plan is...

05:10.043 --> 05:11.210
I'll handle it!

05:11.210 --> 05:14.314
You? Then I will assist you.

05:14.314 --> 05:18.685
No, I can handle this without your help.

05:18.685 --> 05:22.052
So you say, but you've failed
so far, haven't you?

05:23.656 --> 05:25.180
This time will be different!

05:26.025 --> 05:27.583
Skuld...

05:28.761 --> 05:31.898
Very well. We'll let you handle it, Skuld.

05:31.898 --> 05:33.126
Yes.

05:38.237 --> 05:40.137
Good afternoon!

05:40.640 --> 05:42.540
Wow! How cute!

05:45.044 --> 05:47.213
What pretty shoes.

05:47.213 --> 05:48.737
They're wovewy!

05:49.949 --> 05:51.484
Aren't they?

05:51.484 --> 05:54.749
Um, what do you think, Loki?

05:55.855 --> 05:57.652
They look very nice on you, Reiya.

05:59.258 --> 06:01.461
Thanks so much, Loki!

06:01.461 --> 06:05.420
I was thrilled to get such
a wonderful present!

06:05.665 --> 06:07.066
Present?

06:07.066 --> 06:08.124
Yes!

06:12.238 --> 06:15.036
To Reiya
From Loki

06:21.514 --> 06:24.050
Did you send her those, Yamino?

06:24.050 --> 06:25.985
Not that I recall.

06:25.985 --> 06:27.320
Ooh, me too! Me too!

06:27.320 --> 06:30.323
There's this new dress that I want!

06:30.323 --> 06:33.926
It's got a black and white pattern that
gives it a real mysterious look!

06:33.926 --> 06:35.052
Hey, are you listening?

06:35.395 --> 06:36.794
Yeah, yeah...

06:39.132 --> 06:42.761
Loki, I made you some sweets
to say thank you.

06:42.935 --> 06:44.061
Ooh! Sweets!

06:44.704 --> 06:48.572
First, these cookies will make
you sleepy if you eat them.

06:50.510 --> 06:53.880
And if you eat these tarts,
your body will go numb.

06:53.880 --> 06:56.983
If you eat this cake,
you won't stop laughing.

06:56.983 --> 07:00.475
And if you eat this apple pie,
you'll dance till you die!

07:03.222 --> 07:05.825
Is this some kind of joke?

07:05.825 --> 07:07.292
Beats me.

07:08.394 --> 07:10.191
What's wrong, big brother?

07:11.030 --> 07:14.329
Daddy. My body's gone all numb.

07:14.700 --> 07:17.931
Brother! Don't tell me she really
put an anesthetic in those!

07:18.871 --> 07:20.998
That's a good one! As if she put
something in the food!

07:21.574 --> 07:23.041
Oh, that's rich!

07:25.278 --> 07:27.838
Now I'm gonna dance, dance, dance!

07:30.450 --> 07:32.418
He ate them all, didn't he?

07:33.352 --> 07:36.321
Mayura, these things are kind of dangerous,
so please pick them...

07:42.261 --> 07:43.990
Not Mayura too!

07:48.501 --> 07:50.230
This is heavy.

07:50.303 --> 07:51.930
Be careful with that, Reiya!

07:52.271 --> 07:56.230
Loki, I'm going to take your life now, please!

08:02.482 --> 08:03.608
Reiya...

08:06.919 --> 08:08.888
What in the world is going on here?

08:08.888 --> 08:12.346
It looks like someone was controlling her.

08:24.237 --> 08:26.364
Oh, Loki!

08:26.839 --> 08:30.036
So you were thinking about me after all!

08:30.710 --> 08:32.405
Whoa, hold on! Freya...

08:37.250 --> 08:39.411
Okay, break it up, break it up!

08:40.152 --> 08:42.211
The windowpane is shattered.

08:42.655 --> 08:46.526
Freya, you're at an age now where,
yes, you may fall in love...

08:46.526 --> 08:49.862
but as your brother, I cannot
allow you to date this guy!

08:49.862 --> 08:51.261
Don't interfere, big brother!

08:56.302 --> 08:57.803
What the heck?

08:57.803 --> 09:00.033
I can't control myself!

09:04.277 --> 09:07.735
Freya! I know I told you to stay away
from him, but this is a little much!

09:25.932 --> 09:27.400
Those things...

09:27.400 --> 09:29.493
They've been controlling Freya!

09:29.802 --> 09:31.531
Loki, run!

09:41.347 --> 09:45.251
You're the one who put the funny stuff
in my snacks, aren't you?!

09:45.251 --> 09:47.719
Then I'll just make a snack outta you!

09:49.989 --> 09:51.591
Stop this thing!

09:51.591 --> 09:53.286
Where do you think you're going?

10:11.944 --> 10:13.707
Veil lubadrock!

10:26.692 --> 10:28.717
I was so close.

10:58.324 --> 11:00.224
I failed again.

11:00.593 --> 11:03.255
My sisters are going to chew
me out when I get back.

11:15.574 --> 11:19.010
Fruit Parfait
Banana Parfait
Chocolate
Strawberry
Chestnut
Special

11:20.713 --> 11:23.011
They all look like they're
packed with calories.

11:23.516 --> 11:25.751
Okay! I'll have one banana parfait!

11:25.751 --> 11:27.620
I'll have a banana parfait too.

11:27.620 --> 11:29.019
With extra bananas.

11:29.255 --> 11:30.456
Lord Loki?!

11:30.456 --> 11:32.890
The parfaits here are good, aren't they?

11:34.827 --> 11:37.830
What are you up to? Where do you get off
talking all buddy-buddy to me?

11:37.830 --> 11:40.060
Don't you realize that you're my enemy?!

11:40.700 --> 11:43.533
Oh, that's right. I'm the enemy.

11:48.274 --> 11:50.042
Sorry to keep you waiting.

11:50.042 --> 11:52.374
Master Loki! Banana!

11:52.978 --> 11:54.673
Here you go, Ecchan.

12:00.252 --> 12:01.549
Aren't you going to have any?

12:01.921 --> 12:03.422
I'm telling you I'm...

12:03.422 --> 12:05.049
Don't move.

12:08.527 --> 12:10.085
What do you think you're doing?!

12:10.963 --> 12:12.590
There. Nice and pretty.

12:20.372 --> 12:22.340
She wan away.

13:19.865 --> 13:21.467
My...

13:21.467 --> 13:24.527
My mission is to eliminate Lord Loki.

13:30.943 --> 13:32.137
I'm back.

13:33.445 --> 13:35.413
Welcome home, Master Loki.

13:35.948 --> 13:37.677
Welcome back, Daddy.

13:38.250 --> 13:39.410
Where's Mayura?

13:39.785 --> 13:41.412
In the living room.

13:46.826 --> 13:49.795
That certainly was a powerful
sleeping medicine, wasn't it?

13:50.362 --> 13:52.498
Are you all right now, big brother?

13:52.498 --> 13:55.296
You think some drug like that
is enough to do me in?

13:57.269 --> 13:59.999
Hey there! Flower delivery!

14:02.041 --> 14:05.909
Narugami! Now you're working
part-time at a flower shop?

14:06.545 --> 14:08.012
Pretty much.

14:10.950 --> 14:13.118
Something sure smells good!

14:13.118 --> 14:15.387
Let me have some too, Four-Eyes!

14:15.387 --> 14:17.355
Wait, Narugami!

14:19.925 --> 14:21.449
Who could these be from?

14:38.177 --> 14:40.338
Is that supposed to be my guide?

14:55.895 --> 14:58.523
Come on out. Enough hiding.

15:03.569 --> 15:05.594
I've been waiting for you, Lord Loki.

15:06.338 --> 15:09.174
This is a rather strange place to meet
someone for a date, isn't it?

15:09.174 --> 15:11.642
That should make it all the more memorable.

15:21.253 --> 15:23.050
Prepare yourself, Lord Loki.

16:27.186 --> 16:29.221
Why aren't you attacking?

16:29.221 --> 16:31.212
Are you trying to make a fool of me?

16:34.960 --> 16:37.793
You don't think I'm a worthy
opponent, do you?!

16:51.276 --> 16:52.402
Are you all right?

17:32.351 --> 17:33.818
Are you ready to die?

17:36.655 --> 17:38.418
Aren't you afraid?

17:39.158 --> 17:40.626
Let me see...

17:40.626 --> 17:42.719
If you want to beg for your life,
now's your chance!

17:45.030 --> 17:47.021
Why don't you say something?!

17:47.533 --> 17:49.501
You were wearing red shoes
back then too, weren't you?

17:54.473 --> 17:56.441
What was that just now?

17:56.775 --> 17:57.969
Did you remember?

17:58.143 --> 17:59.337
Be quiet!

18:06.618 --> 18:09.849
This is the end for you, Lord Loki.

18:10.322 --> 18:11.949
Goodbye.

18:35.214 --> 18:36.704
Skuld.

19:15.821 --> 19:18.881
Are you all right, Skuld?

19:20.459 --> 19:22.256
Lord Loki.

19:29.201 --> 19:30.668
Those are pretty shoes.

20:08.407 --> 20:10.075
Why...

20:10.075 --> 20:11.804
Why can't I...

20:12.711 --> 20:14.646
He's my enemy!

20:14.646 --> 20:15.704
But I...

20:45.244 --> 20:47.179
This is delicious, Yamino!

20:47.179 --> 20:49.047
Then eat up and have plenty more, okay?

20:49.047 --> 20:51.208
All right, I'll have another
helping too! A big one!

20:51.617 --> 20:54.347
Have at least a little self-control.

20:55.420 --> 20:57.217
Oh! Daddy!

20:58.190 --> 20:59.885
Welcome back!

21:00.125 --> 21:02.218
Welcome home, Master Loki!

21:03.562 --> 21:06.064
Tonight I cooked some of my
special beef stroganoff

21:06.064 --> 21:09.134
using a new-model pressure cooker
I bought via mail order.

21:09.134 --> 21:11.364
I helped too!

21:11.603 --> 21:13.171
Hurry up and eat with us.

21:13.171 --> 21:15.002
Otherwise, I'll eat it all myself!

21:16.341 --> 21:17.638
Sure...

21:32.791 --> 21:34.418
I don't understand.

21:34.760 --> 21:36.625
I don't understand!

21:46.238 --> 21:47.739
I...

21:47.739 --> 21:51.175
Were Loki and I...

22:17.002 --> 22:28.971
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.649 --> 22:42.394
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.394 --> 22:49.601
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.601 --> 22:55.941
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.941 --> 23:05.450
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.450 --> 23:09.788
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.788 --> 23:21.800
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.800 --> 23:23.529
Believe in Heaven

23:31.376 --> 23:32.144
Next Episode

23:32.144 --> 23:34.312
Next Episode
My pain has not subsided.

23:34.312 --> 23:34.713
Next Episode

23:34.713 --> 23:37.382
Next Episode
I have not forgotten my hatred.

23:37.382 --> 23:37.816
Next Episode

23:37.816 --> 23:39.818
Next Episode
Oh, Odin...

23:39.818 --> 23:40.285
Next Episode

23:40.285 --> 23:43.355
Next Episode
It seems the wind here has become
a little too calm.

23:43.355 --> 23:43.822
Next Episode

23:43.822 --> 23:46.091
Next Episode
I will do what must be done.

23:46.091 --> 23:46.458
Next Episode

23:46.458 --> 23:49.628
Next Episode
I will have him return what
he has taken from me.

23:49.628 --> 23:51.797
Next Episode
And I will pay him back...

23:51.797 --> 23:53.532
Next Episode
with death.

23:54.166 --> 23:54.433
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:54.433 --> 23:56.067
The 21st Night
Heimdall, God of the Dawn
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.067 --> 23:58.403
The 21st Night
Heimdall, God of the Dawn
"Heimdall, God of the Dawn"

23:58.403 --> 23:58.570
The 21st Night
Heimdall, God of the Dawn

23:58.570 --> 23:59.037
The 21st Night
Heimdall, God of the Dawn
Farewell, Loki.

23:59.037 --> 24:00.868
Farewell, Loki.
